User -> Screen : propose a supplier not yet on the platform
activate Screen
Screen -> Ctrl : POST /campaigns/provider-proposals (SubmitProviderProposalDto)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : submitProviderProposal(charityUserId, dto)
activate Svc
Svc -> Repo : receiverProfile.findUnique(userId)
Repo --> Svc : receiver | null
alt Receiver profile not found
  Svc --> Ctrl : 404 "Không tìm thấy hồ sơ tổ chức"
